{"id":"3219552411","kind":"answer","title":"为什么感觉艾宾浩斯记忆法不是很有效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学委叶哥的随笔","date":"2023-09-20","updated":"2023-10-23","votes":698,"comment_count":19,"minutes":3,"chars":1457,"keywords":["间隔重复","随机最短路径","测试效应","DHP模型","时间序列"],"summary":"因为艾宾浩斯记忆法根本就是杜撰的。 “艾宾浩斯记忆法“和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系 艾宾浩斯在他的记忆研究中提出的是遗忘曲线。艾宾浩斯自己记忆了多组 无意义音节 拼接成的单词，然后在不同间隔时间后分别复习，再次完全记住相较于第一次记忆所节省的时间。这些间隔分别为 0.33 小时、1 小时、8.8 小时、24 小时、24 小时、6…","question_detail_html":"在记忆知识的时候，我一开始可以较快把它记住，为了不忘记然后开始按艾宾浩斯记忆规律去记忆....一开始记忆感觉脑子是比较舒服的，有点爽爽的感觉，但随着日子的推移，不断重复重复之前的知识，回忆的那种舒服也慢慢消耗殆尽了，感觉就是很枯燥......如果在这个情况下你把这些学习记忆之类的完全抛到脑后去玩一下游戏，或者完全放松不想学习的事两三天...''这些记忆就会快速流失掉，就像在市场上转一个身就发现自己孩子不见了的那种感觉....这是什么情况呀..是我的回忆方式不对还是记忆方式不对吗？求各路大神指点迷津。","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/327469039/answer/3219552411","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"“艾宾浩斯记忆法“和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"到底谁提出了“艾宾浩斯记忆法“？"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"这两本书，连目录都对不上！"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"那到底怎么记，才有效？"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"参考文献"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"M8hcV_H2\">因为艾宾浩斯记忆法根本就是杜撰的。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">“艾宾浩斯记忆法“和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系</h2><p data-pid=\"sBwdkQIV\">艾宾浩斯在他的记忆研究中提出的是遗忘曲线。艾宾浩斯自己记忆了多组<span class=\"nolink\">无意义音节</span>拼接成的单词，然后在不同间隔时间后分别复习，再次完全记住相较于第一次记忆所节省的时间。这些间隔分别为 0.33 小时、1 小时、8.8 小时、24 小时、24 小时、6 天、31 天。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-0261b22e6a105b224175989842402a93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0261b22e6a105b224175989842402a93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"479\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-0261b22e6a105b224175989842402a93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0261b22e6a105b224175989842402a93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"479\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"rVLdAGMn\">看似和网上流传的 5 分钟、30 分钟、12 小时、1 天、2 天、4 天、7 天、15 天非常接近。，但含义却完全不同——艾宾浩斯实际上做了 163 组双重测试（首次记忆+再次记忆），这些实验被分为 7 组，<span class=\"nolink\">再次记忆</span>与首次记忆之间分别相隔 0.33 小时、1 小时、8.8 小时、24 小时、24 小时、6 天、31 天。所以这些复习间隔并不是连续的！</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-d1ab524bcede8cb51de54a66d31d0c20\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d1ab524bcede8cb51de54a66d31d0c20_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"993\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-d1ab524bcede8cb51de54a66d31d0c20\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d1ab524bcede8cb51de54a66d31d0c20_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"993\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"qnck5UBI\">其实想想也就能明白，艾宾浩斯是通过这一组实验绘制的<span class=\"nolink\">遗忘曲线</span>，应当保证每个时间间隔后再次记忆不受干扰。如果艾宾浩斯是连续按照这个复习周期记忆，那他的遗忘曲线应该长成下面这个样子：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-74d89f4346f1f440a351eb5f7bc99f36\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-74d89f4346f1f440a351eb5f7bc99f36_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"681\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-74d89f4346f1f440a351eb5f7bc99f36\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-74d89f4346f1f440a351eb5f7bc99f36_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"681\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"_Xh1h0hD\">而不是这个样子：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-133452dd110c4edfe855d3ddeed2f701\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-133452dd110c4edfe855d3ddeed2f701_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"495\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-133452dd110c4edfe855d3ddeed2f701\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-133452dd110c4edfe855d3ddeed2f701_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"495\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"-zYlzees\">总而言之，艾宾浩斯并没有在他的专著中提出什么<span class=\"nolink\">记忆方法</span>，他仅仅是在研究<span class=\"nolink\">记忆与遗忘</span>的规律。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">到底谁提出了“艾宾浩斯记忆法“？</h2><p data-pid=\"ARQ6G83u\">溯源工作非常困难，但是我还是在一本挂名了艾宾浩斯的书中找到了以下内容：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9ef56a78f5d473cb4a36e6861592ad28_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-273aae910f7e79ae79e042a6472cdcd9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-273aae910f7e79ae79e042a6472cdcd9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"704\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9ef56a78f5d473cb4a36e6861592ad28_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-273aae910f7e79ae79e042a6472cdcd9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-273aae910f7e79ae79e042a6472cdcd9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"704\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-6fdf3ffa024ffc24c003aa9b9ff53111_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f745199fb0eb73c69d8cc85cd6366c2a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f745199fb0eb73c69d8cc85cd6366c2a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"960\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-6fdf3ffa024ffc24c003aa9b9ff53111_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f745199fb0eb73c69d8cc85cd6366c2a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f745199fb0eb73c69d8cc85cd6366c2a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"960\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"gFo7OFoR\">然而，通过对比原版，我发现了一个令人震惊的事实：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-42f999d580106220d7b4f13ae4b8aed2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-6956ffb15e289c0547f52cb1e472f4c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6956ffb15e289c0547f52cb1e472f4c7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"480\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-42f999d580106220d7b4f13ae4b8aed2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-6956ffb15e289c0547f52cb1e472f4c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6956ffb15e289c0547f52cb1e472f4c7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"480\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-3\">这两本书，连目录都对不上！</h2><p data-pid=\"ifsX-4Wf\">《记忆力心理学》的介绍里甚至没有提原版书的名字，这已经让我很奇怪了。没想到内容更是私货满满。自己瞎编了一个复习方法，然后冠上艾宾浩斯之名。</p><p data-pid=\"cgw1PmCE\">当然，可能会有读者朋友问，会不会你找错原版书了？其实翻译的是另外一本？</p><p data-pid=\"iZadjZ8k\">那我建议看看下面两张内容对比：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-29e0ba21f144e3057c4ee65ce8717a93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-29e0ba21f144e3057c4ee65ce8717a93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"963\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-29e0ba21f144e3057c4ee65ce8717a93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-29e0ba21f144e3057c4ee65ce8717a93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"963\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-c35e69fd111e4bb4752548806d61e8f8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c35e69fd111e4bb4752548806d61e8f8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1641\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-c35e69fd111e4bb4752548806d61e8f8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-c35e69fd111e4bb4752548806d61e8f8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1641\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"QEogdR7z\">讨论科学实验的时候，总算是不敢夹带私货，改为直译原文了是吧。我真的服。</p><h2 id=\"sec-4\">那到底怎么记，才有效？</h2><p data-pid=\"VNdPkYSd\">其实按照复习周期多次复习的方法，在心理学上有专门的术语，叫做间隔重复，其利用了测试效应和间隔效应来增强记忆。相关的文献非常多，我这里只列举一二：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2dbc2730b68fac71f549caab01eca920_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1170\" data-image-width=\"2076\" data-tm-id=\"420309917\" href=\"#/post/420309917\">叶峻峣：(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c411e5e812bd614048b34e5a1f48eb9f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1264\" data-image-width=\"2240\" data-tm-id=\"420924493\" href=\"#/post/420924493\">叶峻峣：(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应</a><p data-pid=\"i-rZpKoA\">我自己就是做这个领域研究的，下篇三篇论文介绍了如何通过机器学习方法，找到效率最高的复习周期：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-337e676d732039a25471c1057c54bfa3_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1480\" data-image-width=\"2700\" data-tm-id=\"577383961\" href=\"#/post/577383961\">叶峻峣：KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-634d4ff8b5d7e4f75dbdb943716232fc_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1000\" data-image-width=\"1118\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/626308184\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：[本科毕设] 基于 LSTM 和间隔重复模型的复习算法研究</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5285ed3ff6a616b988d261d5e1ec764f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1526\" data-image-width=\"2752\" data-tm-id=\"656714407\" href=\"#/post/656714407\">叶峻峣：IEEE TKDE 2023 | 墨墨背单词：通过捕捉记忆动态，优化间隔重复调度</a><p data-pid=\"1hDgKowN\">抛开科学理论不谈，要谈实践方法的话，可以尝试使用现成的间隔重复系统，比如 Anki、SuperMemo：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【专栏导航】Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1a8d0bb90f07e4147c5e401dda14d280_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1100\" data-image-width=\"1780\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/374403541\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：渐进学习专栏导读（SuperMemo 使用教程）</a><p data-pid=\"5X0NixEY\">希望这些资源对大家有所帮助。</p><h2 id=\"sec-5\">参考文献</h2><p data-pid=\"9WBrL2RW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.deutschestextarchiv.de/book/view/ebbinghaus_gedaechtnis_1885?p=119\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deutsches Textarchiv – Ebbinghaus, Hermann: Über das Gedächtnis. Leipzig, 1885.</a></p><p data-pid=\"NGDgrAUQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/memorycontributi00ebbiuoft/page/vi/mode/2up\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Memory; a contribution to experimental psychology : Ebbinghaus, Hermann, 1850-1909 : Free Download, Borrow, and Streaming : Internet Archive</a></p><p data-pid=\"t2H9kWoz\"><br/>本文已加入：</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/collection/925510885\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">艾宾浩斯记忆法打假合集</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"577383961","title":"KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]","author":"Junyao Ye","votes":574,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"656714407","title":"IEEE TKDE 2023 | 墨墨背单词：通过捕捉记忆动态，优化间隔重复调度","author":"Jingyong Su","votes":335,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420309917","title":"(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":170,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420924493","title":"(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":95,"minutes":32,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"453406457","title":"(5/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——脚注","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":38,"minutes":51,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"423065882","title":"(4/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——应用指南","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":117,"minutes":29,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"649704369","title":"叶峻峣, 苏敬勇, 曹译珑. 优化间隔重复调度的一种随机最短路径算法[C]//第 28 届 ACM SIGKDD 知识发现与数据挖掘学术会议论文集, 2022: 4381-4390","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1903883577923441191","title":"你的专业领域知识，可以打脸哪个谣言？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":194,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 194 赞同"},{"id":"1918737658743612940","title":"计算机科学好像可以和任何学科交叉，计算机在学科研究方面有什么价值？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":464,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 464 赞同"},{"id":"3242193598","title":"一个人能做出什么开源项目？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":217,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 217 赞同"},{"id":"2901234936","title":"ChatGPT 出现后，那些靠知识记忆取胜的教育模式会被颠覆吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":2309,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 2309 赞同"},{"id":"3488994546","title":"如何评价“间隔重复”这一学习理论？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":40,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 40 赞同"}]}